@bio:

	Jūratė Janutėnaitė-Bogdanienė, PhD, is an associate
	professor at Vilnius Gediminas Technical University. She
	has extensive experience in R&D project development and
	systems engineering, particularly in interdisciplinary
	research combining information technology, mathematics, and
	mechanical engineering. She has a strong background in
	machine learning, software and system development, as well
	as substantial professional experience as a full-stack
	Software Engineer. Her research interests include
	artificial intelligence, mathematical modelling,
	statistical data analysis, big data, and digital
	humanities, with a focus on computational methods and
	digital systems for cultural, musical, and textual heritage
	studies.

@@END: BIO